{"beat_id": "CH03_B08_L0063", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Because the older records are down there, the route just opened, something down there has already reacted to us, and if I go upstairs now I will spend the entire walk thinking about the records I did not read. Also, if the archive decides to close another wall, I'd rather be on the interesting side of it this time.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[NIMERA HAS ALREADY DECIDED]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_08_ARCHIVE_SCRIBE_ENGINE_NIMERA_JOINS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 221}},
